@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@purchaseReceptionId = 421564
@purchaseReceptionNumber = RA10724
@orderNumber = copiar-folio-orden-de-prueba-confirmada
@revision = 2
@version = copiar-version-del-get
@requestKey = generar-uuid-por-recepcion
@receivedAt = 2026-11-23
@warehouse = 01
@orderLineId = copiar-orderLineId-del-get
@receptionId = copiar-id-del-post
@historicalReceptionId = 343646
@cancellationKey = generar-uuid-por-cancelacion
@cancellationDate = copiar-fecha-del-preview
@piecesReceiptId = copiar-id-de-recepcion-de-prueba
@piecesLineId = copiar-id-de-partida-de-recepcion-de-prueba
@piecesRevision = copiar-revision-del-get-de-partida
@piecesRequestKey = generar-uuid-para-alta-de-pieza
@piecesSerial = copiar-serie-sugerida-del-get-de-partida
@pieceId = copiar-id-de-pieza-de-prueba

### Ultimas recepciones
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions?page=1&pageSize=25

### Buscar como el modal OMNIS
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions?documentNumber=RA10724&page=1&pageSize=100

### Buscar por fecha, pedido, referencia de proveedor y almacen
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions?receivedAt=2026-08-28&orderNumber=OA06307&supplierReference=2009047&warehouse=15&page=1&pageSize=25

### Buscar por proveedor
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions?supplierCode=30290&page=1&pageSize=25

### Cargar recepcion por identificador
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{purchaseReceptionId}}

### Cargar recepcion por documento
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/by-number/{{purchaseReceptionNumber}}

### Recepcion anterior
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{purchaseReceptionId}}/previous

### Recepcion siguiente
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{purchaseReceptionId}}/next

### Accion: Auxiliar
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{purchaseReceptionId}}/actions/auxiliary

### Accion: Clasificar
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{purchaseReceptionId}}/actions/classifications

### Cambia Prv / Proveedor actual, elegibilidad y revisión
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{receptionId}}/actions/change-supplier

### Búsqueda de proveedores elegibles por código
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{receptionId}}/actions/change-supplier/suppliers?code=35341

### Confirmar Cambia Prv en una recepción temporal del proveedor 35436
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{receptionId}}/actions/change-supplier
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "revision": "{{version}}",
  "supplierCode": "35341"
}

### Comentarios y revisión para la edición
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{purchaseReceptionId}}/actions/comments

### Guardar comentarios de una recepción temporal con fields y revision del GET
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{receptionId}}/actions/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "revision": "{{version}}",
  "fields": {
    "dueAt": null, "supplierReference": "REFERENCIA-PRUEBA", "department": "01", "orderNumber": "OW00000001",
    "transportCode": "", "processDate": null, "otherLabel": "", "boxes": 0, "volume": 0,
    "folio": "", "folioAt": null, "lines": ["", "", "", "", "Observación de prueba\nSegunda línea"],
    "amountInWords": "", "warehouse": "01"
  }
}

### Consultar elegibilidad para Documenta y copiar amount y revision del GET
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{receptionId}}/actions/document

### Documentar una recepción temporal de 100.00 en dos cargos
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{receptionId}}/actions/document
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestKey": "{{requestKey}}",
  "revision": "{{version}}",
  "documents": [{ "number": "PRUEBA-DO-1", "amount": 40 }, { "number": "PRUEBA-DO-2", "amount": 60 }]
}

### Pedimento de una recepción existente y sus cargos vinculados
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/341534/actions/pedimento

### Piezas registradas en una recepción existente
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{purchaseReceptionId}}/actions/pieces

### Piezas trasladadas desde la orden después de guardar la recepción de prueba
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{receptionId}}/actions/pieces

### Consultar los datos de Pzas. de una partida de prueba
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{piecesReceiptId}}/actions/pieces/lines/{{piecesLineId}}

### Dar de alta una pieza en una recepción de prueba
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{piecesReceiptId}}/actions/pieces/lines/{{piecesLineId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestKey": "{{piecesRequestKey}}",
  "revision": "{{piecesRevision}}",
  "serial": "{{piecesSerial}}",
  "quantity": 1,
  "reference": "PRUEBA-PIEZA"
}

### Cambiar el dato Pzas. con la revisión vigente de la partida de prueba
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{piecesReceiptId}}/actions/pieces/lines/{{piecesLineId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "revision": "{{piecesRevision}}",
  "pieces": "1"
}

### Cambiar la serie de la pieza de prueba
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{piecesReceiptId}}/actions/pieces/{{pieceId}}/serial
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "previousSerial": "{{piecesSerial}}",
  "serial": "SERIE-PRUEBA-02"
}

### Nueva recepción
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/create?orderNumber={{orderNumber}}

### Guardar recepción parcial en Neon de pruebas
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestKey": "{{requestKey}}",
  "revision": {{revision}},
  "legacyVersion": "{{version}}",
  "orderNumber": "{{orderNumber}}",
  "receivedAt": "{{receivedAt}}",
  "warehouse": "{{warehouse}}",
  "supplierReference": "PRUEBA-RECEPCION",
  "lines": [{ "orderLineId": {{orderLineId}}, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### Cargo al proveedor
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{receptionId}}/actions/auxiliary

### Guardar recepción PEPS con pedimento en PostgreSQL de pruebas
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestKey": "{{requestKey}}",
  "revision": {{revision}},
  "legacyVersion": "{{version}}",
  "orderNumber": "{{orderNumber}}",
  "receivedAt": "{{receivedAt}}",
  "warehouse": "{{warehouse}}",
  "supplierReference": "PRUEBA-PEDIMENTO",
  "pedimento": { "number": "250143012345678", "date": "2025-01-14", "customsOffice": "430", "incrementables": 25 },
  "lines": [{ "orderLineId": {{orderLineId}}, "quantity": 1 }]
}

### Entrada de Inventarios
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories/movements/{{receptionId}}

### Consultar el catálogo y revisión de Clasificar
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{historicalReceptionId}}/actions/classifications

### Guardar la clasificación de la recepción en PostgreSQL de pruebas
# Copia la revisión y los nueve códigos del GET. Cambia el valor del grupo que corresponda.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{historicalReceptionId}}/actions/classifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current": {{receiptClassifications}},
  "revision": "{{receiptClassificationRevision}}"
}

### Consultar elegibilidad de una RA histórica en la copia local
GET {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{historicalReceptionId}}/actions/cancel-reception

### Confirmar la baja de la RA en PostgreSQL de pruebas
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchasing/purchase-receptions/{{historicalReceptionId}}/actions/cancel-reception
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestKey": "{{cancellationKey}}",
  "date": "{{cancellationDate}}",
  "reason": "Cancelación de recepción histórica de prueba",
  "confirmed": true
}
